	"title": "Scorpious187's HUD UI for 5e and PF2e/SF2e",
	"description": "Turns the Foundry interface into the device the character is wearing: a Mass Effect omni-tool, a synthwave wrist computer, a Command & Conquer EVA console, or a TRON identity disc; or, for fantasy games, an Adventurer's Journal opened across the table or a Runic Vambrace whose runes weave the sheet in spell-light; and eleven looks over them, from a flickering hologram to an old green terminal. The macro bar rides on the device and its switch raises a projected character sheet over the canvas. Every roll, drag and tab is still the game system's own. Supports PF2e, SF2e and D&D 5e.",
